"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have received systemic corticosteroids within 7 days of first dose of 852A\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have received investigational drugs/agents within 14 days of first dose of 852A\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"Have received immunosuppressive therapy, including cytotoxic agents within 14 days of first dose of 852A\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"Have received nitrosoureas within 30 days of first dose of 852A\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Have received drugs known to induce QT interval prolongation and/or induce Torsades de pointes unless best available drug required to treat life-threatening conditions\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw_text\": \"Have received radiotherapy within 3 weeks of the first dose of 852A\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {